            'ITS ON RAIN HAIL SHINE, BLOOD SWEAT and SNAGS \n\nYou must register your interest on the group page so we can plan for the event….please. A number of sites will be allocated to attendees pending numbers, vehicle and personal capability. Kid are welcome but you’ll be allocated an easier site. 4X4 WITH TRAILER ARE HANDY.\n\nEVENTS CAPPED AT 30 due to resources\n\nREAD THE ADMIN INSTRUCTIONS, NO NQ SAFETY BOOTS\n\nSITES\n\nBUSHLAND BEACH MANGROVES and RAMP\nNORTH SHORE FLATS excluding LIONEL TURNER DRIVE\nEVERETT ST \nTHE BOHLE DALRYMPLE ROAD\n\nAll pending weather and numbers otherwise we’re good to go.\n\nALL COUNCILORS and the MAYOR will receive a personal invitation on TIDY to TIDY Up Townsville Group events this year in there electorate.',
