        postText:
            'TO THE NEW TOWNSVILLE COUNCIL 2024\n\nNo doubt we will see a few new faces this week sitting on the seats at the Council and I’ll invite you all on board this journey the community has started to clean up the joint and put a coat of polish on the place.\n\nFrom weed tree and litter infested road sides to rubbish and dumping filled tracks and recreational areas and waterways you’ll see volunteers this year doing their bit but we can’t do it alone and we need some heavy duty support this year and a concerted effort to make a good looking Ville a reality.\n\nSo welcome aboard, I don’t expect to see you at every event but at least one in the year or tag along on a small group mission but lead your electorates. Show some leadership and help bring others from business to Joe Citizen along on the journey and let’s stop the problem.\n\n#townsvilleenterprise\n#Thisistownsville\n#TownsvilleChamber\n#pink\n#TownsvilleShines\n#TownsvilleBulletin\n#townsvillecitycouncil\n#QueenslandParks',
